menu "AgentZero watch apps"

    # Which launcher apps this build carries. Off does not delete anything: the code stays
    # in the tree, the app just is not registered, so it never runs init() - no tasks, no
    # buffers, no screen. The board is small (ESP32-S3R8) and AskBot gets its memory back.
    #
    # Two things stay compiled whatever is chosen, because other apps lean on them:
    #   - brookesia_app_claude_hud holds the shared BLE transport, the Korean font and the
    #     mic / voice / power device code AskBot uses;
    #   - brookesia_app_chat's core backs the Settings volume slider and the BOOT-button beep.

    config WATCH_APP_CLAUDE_HUD
        bool "Claude HUD app (Claude Code session tiles)"
        default y
        help
            The CREW / SESSIONS / USAGE / INFO tiles fed by the host's HUD endpoint (:8765).

    config WATCH_APP_CHAT
        bool "Chat app (BLE line-protocol voice chat)"
        default y
        help
            Hold-to-talk chat over the older line protocol. When off, its capture, transmit
            and playback tasks are never started, and Settings hides the rows that only
            drive this app (answer mode, test tone).

endmenu
